    {
      "id": "lab_dnp3_long_session",
      "note": "One DNP3 connection: 1,153,440 bytes of class 1-3 polls (48,060 polls, one at a time like a real master), then an FC13 Cold Restart. DNP3 has no per-protocol depth and uses the global stream.reassembly.depth (1 MiB per direction), so the restart is NOT seen at default settings. This fixture documents that limit.",
      "path": "tests/suricata/lab/lab_dnp3_long_session.pcap.gz",
      "sha256": "5c6a9c8ed2e7d97ed724cece81c495def9f60d18e1a8d49fc1d4aad945120e4e",
